      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Paul Atreides unites with Chani and the Fremen while on a warpath of revenge against the\nconspirators who destroyed his family. Facing a choice between the love of his life and the\nfate of the known universe, he endeavors to prevent a terrible future only he can foresee.",
