      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Zendaya is an American actress and singer. She began her career as a child model and backup dancer before\ngaining prominence for her role as Rocky Blue on the Disney Channel sitcom Shake It Up, and went on to star in\nfilms and series across many genres.",
